issue.body:
Logging an object that contains a `bigint` crashes the call instead of logging:

```ts
import { NewLogger, StdoutWriter } from "ctx-log";
NewLogger(StdoutWriter).Info().Any("id", 12345678901234567890n).Msg("x");
// TypeError: Do not know how to serialize a BigInt
```

Expected the value to be logged (e.g. as a string). ctx-log 0.0.7, Node v20.11.1.

